# Sales Dashboard - Data Visualization & Storytelling

## 📌 Objective
The objective of this project is to analyze sales data and create meaningful visualizations that communicate business insights using Microsoft Power BI.

## 🛠 Tools Used
- Microsoft Power BI
- Sample Superstore Dataset

## 📊 Dashboard Features
- Total Sales KPI
- Sales Trend by Year
- Sales by Category
- Sales by Region
- Sales by Segment
- Interactive Dashboard

## 📈 Key Insights
- Total Sales reached **$2.26M**.
- Sales increased consistently from 2015 to 2018.
- Technology generated the highest sales.
- West region recorded the highest sales.
- Consumer segment contributed around 51% of total sales.

## 💡 Business Recommendations
- Increase marketing in the South region.
- Focus on expanding Technology products.
- Improve engagement with Corporate and Home Office customers.
- Track regional performance regularly.

